**1 [[Dagshund]] spawns.
**1 [[Takuya (Enemy)|Takuya]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage is much, much easier if you have finished [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3, as most enemies are easy to finish off with an uber or two—or even better, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]]—as keeping them safe can help massively with the supporting enemies, allowing you to finish off Yuki. (Please keep in mind she outranges Bahamut by 50)

Of course, any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]] crowd-control gacha units can make Yuki a joke, but intense meatshielding is required due to the support enemies (Duche and Dagshund) and the annoying Doge Darks that may shred through your CC units—and Bahamut Cat's Fragile HP.

